<img src="img/hokkaido2_028_small.jpg" width="146" /></a></td><td><a href="#5">
<img src="img/hokkaido2_012_small.jpg" width="146" /></a></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
		<td><a href="#6">
<img src="img/hokkaido2_008_small.jpg" width="146" /></a></td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>
